{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":683,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Removed Content"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate has been removed from the game as of the 29th of October 2020."]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"Platinum Crate may still exist in the game's code, though it is no longer officially used in-game. This page has been preserved for historical purposes."]},"\n"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwBA"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Similar Article"]}]},"This article is about ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]},". You may be looking for the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Premium_Crate","title":"Premium Crate"},"children":["Premium Crate"]}," or ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Golden_Crate","title":"Golden Crate"},"children":["Golden Crate"]},"."]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBg"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Platinum_Crate"},"children":["Platinum Crate"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCQ"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCw"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwDQ"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["A shiny reward for triumphing many maps."]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["―"]},"Inventory Description"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n","\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]}," was a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Crates","title":"Crates"},"children":["crate"]}," that could have been obtained by triumphing 5 different maps on all four difficulties (",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Easy_Mode","title":"Easy Mode"},"children":["Beginner's"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Molten_Mode","title":"Molten Mode"},"children":["Molten"]},", ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Golden_Mode","title":"Golden Mode"},"children":["Golden"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Fallen_Mode","title":"Fallen Mode"},"children":["Fallen"]},"). You did not need to have a perfect run throughout those rounds, meaning that you could lose base health on those runs. You could also complete maps in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/MEGA_Servers","title":"MEGA Servers"},"children":["MEGA Servers"]},". The maps in question must have been beaten on all difficulties after the 8th of December 2019. For this reason, some maps with all four medals would not count to the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]}," yet. Maps that you completed would have a star next to them. This did not include maps that were counted for a previous ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]},", if you had claimed one before. Your medals would still remain when you claimed a ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]},", making it difficult to keep track of what maps you needed to do to get the next ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["After you claimed a ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]},", all previous medals earned on all maps no longer counted towards another ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]},", even if they did not contribute to a previously earned ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]},". This meant that you had to repeat all the medals that you have earned, if you wanted to earn another ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]},", even if the map showed that you have earned all medals. However, you could repeat maps that had previously counted for a different ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Like the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Golden_Crate","title":"Golden Crate"},"children":["Golden Crate"]},", the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]}," gave buffs to towers, although these buffs were not as strong. However, the crates were effectively free since you did not need to use coins to buy this crate."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwJQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Appearance"},"children":["Appearance"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Platinum Crate"]}," was similar in design to the original ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Golden_Crate","title":"Golden Crate"},"children":["Golden Crate"]},", with the exception that it was colored in sirocco rather than yellow."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwKQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Former_Skins"},"children":["Former Skins"]},"\n",{"type":"table","props":{"id":"mwKg"},"children":["\n",{"type":"tbody","props":{},"children":[{"type":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"th","props":{"id":"mwLQ"},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"td","props":{"id":"mwLg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwLw"},"children":[